{"slug": "microservices-vs-monolith", "voice": "bf_emma", "accent": "uk", "sampleRate": 24000, "duration": 305.925, "contentHash": "9aa738c74c0997764677730d2bc7faf2fc36d891529a007ecb490f40830dcf1d", "blocks": [{"index": 0, "kind": "title", "text": "Microservices vs. Monolith", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.025, "words": [{"text": "Microservices", "start": 0.25, "end": 1.288}, {"text": "vs", "start": 1.288, "end": 1.775}, {"text": "Monolith", "start": 1.775, "end": 2.7}]}, {"index": 1, "kind": "summary", "text": "The most argued-over trade-off in backend architecture: when splitting services pays off, when a modular monolith wins, and how to avoid the distributed monolith.", "start": 3.025, "end": 13.075, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 3.275, "end": 3.35}, {"text": "most", "start": 3.35, "end": 3.688}, {"text": "argued", "start": 3.688, "end": 8.025}, {"text": "over", "start": 8.025, "end": 8.025}, {"text": "trade", "start": 8.025, "end": 8.025}, {"text": "off", "start": 8.025, "end": 8.375}, {"text": "in", "start": 8.375, "end": 8.412}, {"text": "backend", "start": 8.412, "end": 8.412}, {"text": "architecture", "start": 8.412, "end": 8.412}, {"text": "when", "start": 8.412, "end": 8.537}, {"text": "splitting", "start": 8.537, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "services", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "pays", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "off", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "when", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "a", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "modular", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "monolith", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "wins", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "and", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "how", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "to", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "avoid", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "the", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "distributed", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}, {"text": "monolith", "start": 12.975, "end": 12.975}]}, {"index": 2, "kind": "prose", "text": "Why this matters", "start": 13.075, "end": 15.0, "words": [{"text": "Why", "start": 13.325, "end": 13.55}, {"text": "this", "start": 13.55, "end": 13.75}, {"text": "matters", "start": 13.75, "end": 14.75}]}, {"index": 3, "kind": "prose", "text": "Few topics generate more confident wrongness than this one. \"Microservices\" has been both sold as the inevitable future and blamed for spectacular engineering face-plants — sometimes about the same company. The honest version is boring and useful: it's a trade-off about team scaling and failure isolation versus operational simplicity, and the right answer depends on your organization more than your technology. Get it wrong in either direction and you'll feel it for years.", "start": 15.0, "end": 41.925, "words": [{"text": "Few", "start": 15.275, "end": 15.45}, {"text": "topics", "start": 15.45, "end": 15.85}, {"text": "generate", "start": 15.85, "end": 16.3}, {"text": "more", "start": 16.3, "end": 16.475}, {"text": "confident", "start": 16.475, "end": 17.0}, {"text": "wrongness", "start": 17.0, "end": 17.425}, {"text": "than", "start": 17.425, "end": 17.562}, {"text": "this", "start": 17.562, "end": 17.775}, {"text": "one", "start": 17.775, "end": 18.475}, {"text": "Microservices", "start": 18.475, "end": 19.75}, {"text": "has", "start": 19.75, "end": 19.938}, {"text": "been", "start": 19.938, "end": 20.075}, {"text": "both", "start": 20.075, "end": 20.35}, {"text": "sold", "start": 20.35, "end": 20.663}, {"text": "as", "start": 20.663, "end": 20.762}, {"text": "the", "start": 20.762, "end": 20.85}, {"text": "inevitable", "start": 20.85, "end": 21.462}, {"text": "future", "start": 21.462, "end": 22.2}, {"text": "and", "start": 22.2, "end": 22.35}, {"text": "blamed", "start": 22.35, "end": 22.7}, {"text": "for", "start": 22.7, "end": 22.825}, {"text": "spectacular", "start": 22.825, "end": 23.45}, {"text": "engineering", "start": 23.45, "end": 24.025}, {"text"