", "start": 38.737, "end": 38.85}, {"text": "wrong", "start": 38.85, "end": 39.125}, {"text": "in", "start": 39.125, "end": 39.225}, {"text": "either", "start": 39.225, "end": 39.475}, {"text": "direction", "start": 39.475, "end": 40.025}, {"text": "and", "start": 40.025, "end": 40.138}, {"text": "you'll", "start": 40.138, "end": 40.275}, {"text": "feel", "start": 40.275, "end": 40.487}, {"text": "it", "start": 40.487, "end": 40.6}, {"text": "for", "start": 40.6, "end": 40.725}, {"text": "years", "start": 40.725, "end": 41.65}]}, {"index": 4, "kind": "prose", "text": "The analogy: a monolith is one big restaurant kitchen — every cook in one room, shouting distance from everyone else. Communication is instant, but Thanksgiving dinner for 400 means chaos in a single space. Microservices are a food court — each stall independent, with its own staff, menu, and hours. One stall's grease fire doesn't close the others, but now you need shared plumbing, shared seating, and a directory so customers can find the dumplings.", "start": 41.925, "end": 67.625, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 42.175, "end": 42.3}, {"text": "analogy", "start": 42.3, "end": 43.0}, {"text": "a", "start": 43.0, "end": 43.2}, {"text": "monolith", "start": 43.2, "end": 43.65}, {"text": "is", "start": 43.65, "end": 43.8}, {"text": "one", "start": 43.8, "end": 44.025}, {"text": "big", "start": 44.025, "end": 44.25}, {"text": "restaurant", "start": 44.25, "end": 44.675}, {"text": "kitchen", "start": 44.675, "end": 45.225}, {"text": "every", "start": 45.225, "end": 45.575}, {"text": "cook", "start": 45.575, "end": 45.787}, {"text": "in", "start": 45.787, "end": 45.9}, {"text": "one", "start": 45.9, "end": 46.125}, {"text": "room", "start": 46.125, "end": 46.4}, {"text": "shouting", "start": 46.4, "end": 46.875}, {"text": "distance", "start": 46.875, "end": 47.3}, {"text": "from", "start": 47.3, "end": 47.438}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 47.438, "end": 47.8}, {"text": "else", "start": 47.8, "end": 48.65}, {"text": "Communication", "start": 48.65, "end": 49.462}, {"text": "is", "start": 49.462, "end": 49.6}, {"text": "instant", "start": 49.6, "end": 50.05}, {"text": "but", "start": 50.05, "end": 50.225}, {"text": "Thanksgiving", "start": 50.225, "end": 50.775}, {"text": "dinner", "start": 50.775, "end": 51.025}, {"text": "for", "start": 51.025, "end": 51.15}, {"text": "400", "start": 51.15, "end": 51.6}, {"text": "means", "start": 51.6, "end": 51.9}, {"text": "chaos", "start": 51.9, "end": 52.3}, {"text": "in", "start": 52.3, "end": 52.387}, {"text": "a", "start": 52.387, "end": 52.45}, {"text": "single", "start": 52.45, "end": 52.775}, {"text": "space", "start": 52.775, "end": 53.725}, {"text": "Microservices", "start": 53.725, "end": 54.7}, {"text": "are", "start": 54.7, "end": 54.787}, {"text": "a", "start": 54.787, "end": 54.862}, {"text": "food", "start": 54.862, "end": 55.125}, {"text": "court", "start": 55.125, "end": 55.65}, {"text": "each", "start": 55.65, "end": 55.95}, {"text": "stall", "start": 55.95, "end": 56.237}, {"text": "independent", "start": 56.237, "end": 56.9}, {"text": "with", "start": 56.9, "end": 57.087}, {"text": "its", "start": 57.087, "end": 57.2}, {"text": "own", "start": 57.2, "end": 57.45}, {"text": "staff", "start": 57.45, "end": 57.8}, {"text": "menu", "start": 57.8, "end": 58.15}, {"text": "and", "start": 58.15, "end": 58.3}, {"text": "hours", "start": 58.3, "end": 59.25}, {"text": "One", "start": 59.25, "end": 59.6}, {"text": "stall's", "start": 59.6, "end": 59.95}, {"text": "grease", "start": 59.95, "end": 60.25}, {"text": "fire", "start": 60.25, "end": 60.55}, {"text": "doesn't", "start": 60.55, "end": 60.825}, {"text": "close", "start": 60.825, "end": 61.112}, {"text": "the", "start": 61.112, "end": 61.2}, {"text": "others", "start": 61.2, "end": 61.825}, {"text": "but", "start": 61.825, "end": 62.05}, {"text": "now", "start": 62.05, "end": 62.25}, {"text": "you", "start": 62.25, "end": 62.375}, {"text": "need", "start": 62.375, "end": 62.637}, {"text": "shared", "start": 62.637, "end": 62.975}, {"text": "plumbing", "start": 62.975, "end": 63.4}, {"text": "shared", "start": 63.4, "end": 63.775}, {"text": "seating", "start": 63.775, "end": 64.275}, {"text": "and", "start": 64.275, "end": 64.463}, {"text": "a", "start": 64.463, "end": 64.525}, {"text": "directory", "start": 64.525, "end": 65.05}, {"text": "so", "start": 65.05, "end": 65.225}, {"text": "customers", "start": 65.225, "end": 65.775}, {"text": "can", "start": 65.775, "end": 65.95}, {"text": "find", "start": 65.95, "end": 66.188}, {"text": "the", "start": 66.188, "end": 66.275}, {"text": "dumplings", "start": 66.275, "end": 67.35}]}, {"index": 5, "kind": "prose", "text": "What each buys you", "start": 67.625, "end": 69.6, "words": [{"text": "What", "start": 67.875, "end": 68.1}, {"text": "each", "start": 68.1, "end": 68.375}, {"text": "buys", "start": 68.375, "end": 68.75}, {"text": "you", "start": 68.75, "end": 69.45}]}, {"index": 6, "kind": "prose", "text": "Monolith strengths: one codebase to understand, one deployment pipeline, function calls instead of network calls (no serialization, no partial failure, no latency), trivial refactoring across boundaries, and transactions that actually work (see Distributed Transactions for what you give up). Debugging is pleasant — the stack trace is right there.", "start": 69.6, "end": 90.15, "words": [{"text": "Monolith", "start": 69.9, "end": 70.3}, {"text": "strengths", "start": 70.3, "end": 71.1}, {"text": "one", "start": 71.1, "end": 71.425}, {"text": "codebase", "start": 71.425, "end": 71.925}, {"text": "to", "start": 71.925, "end": 72.012}, {"text": "understand", "start": 72.012, "end": 72.6}, {"text": "one", "start": 72.6, "end": 72.875}, {"text": "deployment", "start": 72.875, "end": 73.3}, {"text": "pipeline", "start": 73.3, "end": 73.925}, {"text": "function", "start": 73.925, "end": 74.475}, {"text": "calls", "start": 74.475, "end": 74.837}, {"text": "instead", "start": 74.837, "end": 75.162}, {"text": "of", "start": 75.162, "end": 75.25}, {"text": "network", "start": 75.25, "end": 75.675}, {"text": "calls", "start": 75.675, "end": 76.412}, {"text": "no", "start": 76.412, "end": 76.688}, {"text": "serialization", "start": 76.688, "end": 77.625}, {"text": "no", "start": 77.625, "end": 77.85}, {"text": "partial", "start": 77.85, "end": 78.25}, {"text": "failure", "start": 78.25, "end": 78.625}, {"text": "no", "start": 78.625, "end": 78.85}, {"text": "latency", "start": 78.85, "end": 79.675}, {"text": "trivial", "start": 79.675, "end": 80.2}, {"text": "refactoring", "start": 80.2, "end": 80.762}, {"text": "across", "start": 80.762, "end": 81.075}, {"text": "boundaries", "start": 81.075, "end": 81.625}, {"text": "and", "start": 81.625, "end": 81.775}, {"text": "transactions", "start": 81.775, "end": 82.438}, {"text": "that", "start": 82.438, "end": 82.55}, {"text": "actually", "start": 82.55, "end": 82.95}, {"text": "work", "start": 82.95, "end": 83.487}, {"text": "see", "start": 83.487, "end": 83.725}, {"text": "Distributed", "start": 83.725, "end": 84.325}, {"text": "Transactions", "start": 84.325, "end": 85.075}, {"text": "for", "start": 85.075, "end": 85.188}, {"text": "what", "start": 85.188, "end": 85.325}, {"text": "you", "start": 85.325, "end": 85.45}, {"text": "give", "start": 85.45, "end": 85.612}, {"text": "up", "start": 85.612, "end": 86.35}, {"text": "Debugging", "start": 86.35, "end": 87.15}, {"text": "is", "start": 87.15, "end": 87.3}, {"text": "pleasant", "start": 87.3, "end": 87.95}, {"text": "the", "start": 87.95, "end": 88.1}, {"text": "stack", "start": 88.1, "end": 88.425}, {"text": "trace", "start": 88.425, "end": 88.737}, {"text": "is", "start": 88.737, "end": 88.85}, {"text": "right", "start": 88.85, "end": 89.1}, {"text": "there", "start": 89.1, "end": 89.875}]}, {"index": 7, "kind": "prose", "text": "Microservices strengths: independent deployment (the search team ships without waiting for the billing team), independent scaling (scale the hot service, not everything), technology choice per service, and failure isolation — one service's memory leak pages one team instead of taking down the site. This last one is the real prize at scale.", "start": 90.15, "end": 109.875, "words": [{"text": "Microservices", "start": 90.425, "end": 91.175}, {"text": "strengths", "start": 91.175, "end": 92.05}, {"text": "independent", "start": 92.05, "end": 92.775}, {"text": "deployment", "start": 92.775, "end": 93.55}, {"text": "the", "start": 93.55, "end": 93.675}, {"text": "search", "start": 93.675, "end": 93.975}, {"text": "team", "start": 93.975, "end": 94.238}, {"text": "ships", "start": 94.238, "end": 94.513}, {"text": "without", "start": 94.513, "end": 94.825}, {"text": "waiting", "start": 94.825, "end": 95.15}, {"text": "for", "start": 95.15, "end": 95.263}, {"text": "the", "start": 95.263, "end": 95.35}, {"text": "billing", "start": 95.35, "end": 95.65}, {"text": "team", "start": 95.65, "end": 96.2}, {"text": "independent", "start": 96.2, "end": 96.95}, {"text": "scaling", "start": 96.95, "end": 97.425}, {"text": "scale", "start": 97.425, "end": 97.788}, {"text": "the", "start": 97.788, "end": 97.875}, {"text": "hot", "start": 97.875, "end": 98.1}, {"text": "service", "start": 98.1, "end": 98.55}, {"text": "not", "start": 98.55, "end": 98.8}, {"text": "everything", "start": 98.8, "end": 99.525}, {"text": "technology", "start": 99.525, "end": 100.213}, {"text": "choice", "start": 100.213, "end": 100.525}, {"text": "per", "start": 100.525, "end": 100.675}, {"text": "service", "start": 100.675, "end": 101.1}, {"text": "and", "start": 101.1, "end": 101.263}, {"text": "failure", "start": 101.263, "end": 101.65}, {"text": "isolation", "start": 101.65, "end": 102.625}, {"text": "one", "start": 102.625, "end": 102.925}, {"text": "service's", "start": 102.925, "end": 103.425}, {"text": "memory", "start": 103.425, "end": 103.85}, {"text": "leak", "start": 103.85, "end": 104.1}, {"text": "pages", "start": 104.1, "end": 104.5}, {"text": "one", "start": 104.5, "end": 104.725}, {"text": "team", "start": 104.725, "end": 104.988}, {"text": "instead", "start": 104.988, "end": 105.312}, {"text": "of", "start": 105.312, "end": 105.4}, {"text": "taking", "start": 105.4, "end": 105.725}, {"text": "down", "start": 105.725, "end": 105.913}, {"text": "the", "start": 105.913, "end": 106.013}, {"text": "site", "start": 106.013, "end": 106.9}, {"text": "This", "start": 106.9, "end": 107.25}, {"text": "last", "start": 107.25, "end": 107.562}, {"text": "one", "start": 107.562, "end": 107.75}, {"text": "is", "start": 107.75, "end": 107.863}, {"text": "the", "start": 107.863, "end": 107.95}, {"text": "real", "start": 107.95, "end": 108.225}, {"text": "prize", "start": 108.225, "end": 108.575}, {"text": "at", "start": 108.575, "end": 108.675}, {"text": "scale", "start": 108.675, "end": 109.6}]}, {"index": 8, "kind": "prose", "text": "Conway's law: the part nobody warns you about", "start": 109.875, "end": 113.2, "words": [{"text": "Conway's", "start": 110.125, "end": 110.6}, {"text": "law", "start": 110.6, "end": 110.925}, {"text": "the", "start": 110.925, "end": 111.075}, {"text": "part", "start": 111.075, "end": 111.4}, {"text": "nobody", "start": 111.4, "end": 111.75}, {"text": "warns", "start": 111.75, "end": 112.013}, {"text": "you", "start": 112.013, "end": 112.112}, {"text": "about", "start": 112.112, "end": 112.925}]}, {"index": 9, "kind": "prose", "text": "\"Organizations design systems that mirror their own communication structure.\" — Melvin Conway, 1968 (written 1967)", "start": 113.2, "end": 122.4, "words": [{"text": "Organizations", "start": 113.4, "end": 114.275}, {"text": "design", "start": 114.275, "end": 114.7}, {"text": "systems", "start": 114.7, "end": 115.188}, {"text": "that", "start": 115.188, "end": 115.3}, {"text": "mirror", "start": 115.3, "end": 115.575}, {"text": "their", "start": 115.575, "end": 115.775}, {"text": "own", "start": 115.775, "end": 116.0}, {"text": "communication", "start": 116.0, "end": 116.725}, {"text": "structure", "start": 116.725, "end": 117.7}, {"text": "Melvin", "start": 117.7, "end": 118.325}, {"text": "Conway", "start": 118.325, "end": 118.8}, {"text": "1968", "start": 118.8, "end": 120.188}, {"text": "written", "start": 120.188, "end": 120.525}, {"text": "1967", "start": 120.525, "end": 122.1}]}, {"index": 10, "kind": "prose", "text": "This is the closest thing our field has to a law of physics. Three teams that never talk will produce three services with awkward seams in exactly the places the teams don't talk. Microservices don't fix communication problems — they fossilize them into network boundaries. If your org chart is a mess, your service diagram will be a mess with latency.", "start": 122.4, "end": 142.775, "words": [{"text": "This", "start": 122.65, "end": 122.85}, {"text": "is", "start": 122.85, "end": 122.963}, {"text": "the", "start": 122.963, "end": 123.05}, {"text": "closest", "start": 123.05, "end": 123.475}, {"text": "thing", "start": 123.475, "end": 123.663}, {"text": "our", "start": 123.663, "end": 123.838}, {"text": "field", "start": 123.838, "end": 124.225}, {"text": "has", "start": 124.225, "end": 124.425}, {"text": "to", "start": 124.425, "end": 124.525}, {"text": "a", "start": 124.525, "end": 124.6}, {"text": "law", "start": 124.6, "end": 124.788}, {"text": "of", "start": 124.788, "end": 124.875}, {"text": "physics", "start": 124.875, "end": 125.775}, {"text": "Three", "start": 125.775, "end": 126.125}, {"text": "teams", "start": 126.125, "end": 126.513}, {"text": "that", "start": 126.513, "end": 126.625}, {"text": "never", "start": 126.625, "end": 126.888}, {"text": "talk", "start": 126.888, "end": 127.213}, {"text": "will", "start": 127.213, "end": 127.325}, {"text": "produce", "start": 127.325, "end": 127.7}, {"text": "three", "start": 127.7, "end": 127.95}, {"text": "services", "start": 127.95, "end": 128.513}, {"text": "with", "start": 128.513, "end": 128.65}, {