 five genuinely independent teams stepping on each other in one repo, splitting is how you stop the merge-conflict wars. Architecture follows org, not the other way around.", "start": 142.775, "end": 155.025, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 143.025, "end": 143.1}, {"text": "flip", "start": 143.1, "end": 143.375}, {"text": "side", "start": 143.375, "end": 144.025}, {"text": "if", "start": 144.025, "end": 144.263}, {"text": "you", "start": 144.263, "end": 144.363}, {"text": "have", "start": 144.363, "end": 144.562}, {"text": "five", "start": 144.562, "end": 144.938}, {"text": "genuinely", "start": 144.938, "end": 145.438}, {"text": "independent", "start": 145.438, "end": 145.975}, {"text": "teams", "start": 145.975, "end": 146.325}, {"text": "stepping", "start": 146.325, "end": 146.662}, {"text": "on", "start": 146.662, "end": 146.763}, {"text": "each", "start": 146.763, "end": 146.938}, {"text": "other", "start": 146.938, "end": 147.175}, {"text": "in", "start": 147.175, "end": 147.3}, {"text": "one", "start": 147.3, "end": 147.475}, {"text": "repo", "start": 147.475, "end": 148.075}, {"text": "splitting", "start": 148.075, "end": 148.7}, {"text": "is", "start": 148.7, "end": 148.825}, {"text": "how", "start": 148.825, "end": 149.025}, {"text": "you", "start": 149.025, "end": 149.15}, {"text": "stop", "start": 149.15, "end": 149.425}, {"text": "the", "start": 149.425, "end": 149.525}, {"text": "merge", "start": 149.525, "end": 150.275}, {"text": "conflict", "start": 150.275, "end": 150.275}, {"text": "wars", "start": 150.275, "end": 151.35}, {"text": "Architecture", "start": 151.35, "end": 152.15}, {"text": "follows", "start": 152.15, "end": 152.525}, {"text": "org", "start": 152.525, "end": 152.95}, {"text": "not", "start": 152.95, "end": 153.238}, {"text": "the", "start": 153.238, "end": 153.325}, {"text": "other", "start": 153.325, "end": 153.575}, {"text": "way", "start": 153.575, "end": 153.775}, {"text": "around", "start": 153.775, "end": 154.725}]}, {"index": 12, "kind": "prose", "text": "The distributed monolith: the worst of both", "start": 155.025, "end": 158.3, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 155.275, "end": 155.35}, {"text": "distributed", "start": 155.35, "end": 156.05}, {"text": "monolith", "start": 156.05, "end": 156.6}, {"text": "the", "start": 156.6, "end": 156.8}, {"text": "worst", "start": 156.8, "end": 157.113}, {"text": "of", "start": 157.113, "end": 157.2}, {"text": "both", "start": 157.2, "end": 157.975}]}, {"index": 13, "kind": "prose", "text": "The failure mode to fear has a name: the distributed monolith. It looks like microservices (many deployables, network calls everywhere) but behaves like a monolith (everything must deploy together, one service's change breaks five others, no independent scaling). You get all the operational pain of distribution with none of the autonomy. Telltale signs: distributed transactions across services, lockstep deployments, and a \"service\" diagram that is really one big ball of mud with HTTP in the middle.", "start": 158.3, "end": 188.775, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 158.55, "end": 158.625}, {"text": "failure", "start": 158.625, "end": 159.0}, {"text": "mode", "start": 159.0, "end": 159.225}, {"text": "to", "start": 159.225, "end": 159.35}, {"text": "fear", "start": 159.35, "end": 159.6}, {"text": "has", "start": 159.6, "end": 159.738}, {"text": "a", "start": 159.738, "end": 159.8}, {"text": "name", "start": 159.8, "end": 160.3}, {"text": "the", "start": 160.3, "end": 160.475}, {"text": "distributed", "start": 160.475, "end": 161.125}, {"text": "monolith", "start": 161.125, "end": 162.025}, {"text": "It", "start": 162.025, "end": 162.275}, {"text": "looks", "start": 162.275, "end": 162.525}, {"text": "like", "start": 162.525, "end": 162.75}, {"text": "microservices", "start": 162.75, "end": 163.725}, {"text": "many", "start": 163.725, "end": 164.0}, {"text": "deployables", "start": 164.0, "end": 164.65}, {"text": "network", "start": 164.65, "end": 165.1}, 