xt": "services", "start": 181.275, "end": 181.9}, {"text": "lockstep", "start": 181.9, "end": 182.35}, {"text": "deployments", "start": 182.35, "end": 183.325}, {"text": "and", "start": 183.325, "end": 183.513}, {"text": "a", "start": 183.513, "end": 183.575}, {"text": "service", "start": 183.575, "end": 184.075}, {"text": "diagram", "start": 184.075, "end": 184.725}, {"text": "that", "start": 184.725, "end": 184.875}, {"text": "is", "start": 184.875, "end": 185.038}, {"text": "really", "start": 185.038, "end": 185.375}, {"text": "one", "start": 185.375, "end": 185.6}, {"text": "big", "start": 185.6, "end": 185.838}, {"text": "ball", "start": 185.838, "end": 186.062}, {"text": "of", "start": 186.062, "end": 186.175}, {"text": "mud", "start": 186.175, "end": 186.525}, {"text": "with", "start": 186.525, "end": 186.7}, {"text": "HTTP", "start": 186.7, "end": 187.5}, {"text": "in", "start": 187.5, "end": 187.588}, {"text": "the", "start": 187.588, "end": 187.675}, {"text": "middle", "start": 187.675, "end": 188.5}]}, {"index": 14, "kind": "prose", "text": "The modular monolith: the underrated middle", "start": 188.775, "end": 192.0, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 189.025, "end": 189.125}, {"text": "modular", "start": 189.125, "end": 189.525}, {"text": "monolith", "start": 189.525, "end": 190.05}, {"text": "the", "start": 190.05, "end": 190.275}, {"text": "underrated", "start": 190.275, "end": 190.95}, {"text": "middle", "start": 190.95, "end": 191.775}]}, {"index": 15, "kind": "prose", "text": "Here's the option the discourse skips: a modular monolith — one deployable, but with strict internal module boundaries (separate packages, explicit interfaces, no sneaky cross-imports). You keep the monolith's operational simplicity while practicing the discipline microservices force on you. If a module later needs independent scaling, the boundary is already drawn — extraction becomes a mechanical move, not an archaeology project. Shopify runs one of the world's largest Rails monoliths this way; Amazon Prime Video famously moved back from microservices to a monolith for one workload and cut infrastructure costs about 90 percent.", "start": 192.0, "end": 229.525, "words": [{"text": "Here's", "start": 192.25, "end": 192.463}, {"text": "the", "start": 192.463, "end": 192.575}, {"text": "option", "start": 192.575, "end": 192.912}, {"text": "the", "start": 192.912, "end": 193.0}, {"text": "discourse", "start": 193.0, "end": 193.425}, {"text": "skips", "start": 193.425, "end": 194.15}, {"text": "a", "start": 194.15, "end": 194.35}, {"text": "modular", "start": 194.35, "end": 194.75}, {"text": "monolith", "start": 194.75, "end": 195.213}, {"text": "one", "start": 195.213, "end": 195.5}, {"text": "deployable", "start": 195.5, "end": 196.2}, {"text": "but", "start": 196.2, "end": 196.412}, {"text": "with", "start": 196.412, "end": 196.55}, {"text": "strict", "start": 196.55, "end": 196.9}, {"text": "internal", "start": 196.9, "end": 197.35}, {"text": "module", "start": 197.35, "end": 197.675}, {"text": "boundaries", "start": 197.675, "end": 198.325}, {"text": "separate", "start": 198.325, "end": 198.725}, {"text": "packages", "start": 198.725, "end": 199.325}, {"text": "explicit", "start": 199.325, "end": 199.887}, {"text": "interfaces", "start": 199.887, "end": 200.55}, {"text": "no", "start": 200.55, "end": 200.787}, {"text": "sneaky", "start": 200.787, "end": 201.125}, {"text": "cross", "start": 201.125, "end": 202.35}, {"text": "imports", "start": 202.35, "end": 202.35}, {"text": "You", "start": 202.35, "end": 202.5}, {"text": "keep", "start": 202.5, "end": 202.662}, {"text": "the", "start": 202.662, "end": 202.75}, {"text": "monolith's", "start": 202.75, "end": 203.225}, {"text": "operational", "start": 203.225, "end": 203.875}, {"text": "simplicity", "start": 203.875, "end": 204.475}, {"text": "while", "start": 204.475, "end": 204.65}, {"text": "practicing", "start": 204.65, "end": 205.162}, {"text": "the", "start": 205.162, "end": 205.25